<tei:p><tei:pb n="622" ed="1949 festival musaf" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n646_medium.jpg"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:regalim/musaf/text/retzeh"/>Be pleased, Lord our God, with thy people Israel and with their prayer; restore the worship to thy most holy sanctuary; accept Israel’s offerings and prayer with gracious love. May the worship of thy people Israel be ever pleasing to thee.<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
